Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.71,0:01:07.48,Song,,0,0,0,,Searching for the key \Nthat can outrun the seasons {imma assume these songs don't exist outside this ova either, translating by ear}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.93,0:01:15.11,Song,,0,0,0,,The ending is wrapped in a frustrating trap
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.11,0:01:21.00,Song,,0,0,0,,What's so wrong \Nwith making nothing but mistakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.11,0:01:31.15,Song,,0,0,0,,Love and dreams that depend \Non someone else's mood are a no-go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.15,0:01:37.46,Song,,0,0,0,,Super — right now I'm living free!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.52,0:01:45.26,Song,,0,0,0,,{no chance}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.42,0:01:52.52,Song,,0,0,0,,{no clue}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:59.01,Song,,0,0,0,,Bring on the endless storms
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.80,0:02:07.92,Song,,0,0,0,,Searching for the key \Nthat can outrun the seasons {restarted from the first line}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.92,0:02:13.78,Song,,0,0,0,,The ending is wrapped in a frustrating trap
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.59,0:02:21.41,Song,,0,0,0,,What's so wrong \Nwith making nothing but mistakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.15,0:02:30.55,Song,,0,0,0,,Love and dreams that depend \Non someone else's mood are a no-go
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.16,0:02:37.96,Song,,0,0,0,,Super — right now I'm living free!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.54,0:02:45.38,Song,,0,0,0,,The colors after the sound \Nmelt into the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.38,0:02:47.44,Song,,0,0,0,,It's not a lie... {????}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.01,0:02:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Isao-chan, you're rushing it. \NThe rhythm's all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.70,0:02:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially the bass drum — watch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And Yuichi-kun, what happened? \NYou flubbed way too many parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.33,0:03:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... Yeah, sorry. \NI just couldn't get into it. {in the zone/groove}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.05,0:03:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you just haven't been practicing enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.23,0:03:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the leader, so act like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.58,0:03:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let me say this as your leader...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.78,0:03:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,once more from the start!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.22,0:03:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.06,0:03:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and Saori. On the chorus, \Ncan you get into it a little more?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.20,0:03:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, I mean... kinda...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.40,0:03:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,really pour your emotions into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.86,0:03:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying. You want even more?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.36,0:03:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Think about the guy you like and give it one more push.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.43,0:03:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got one, don't you, Note-kun? {onmei = note name; pitch name; letter notation​ - idk why; onmei can also be "gracious command or words" since she's the singer?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.83,0:03:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I-Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.09,0:03:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Right... Sorry, guys. \NI'm gonna have to skip today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.01,0:04:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.85,0:04:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.02,0:04:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry! I swear I'll have it \Nnailed down before the show!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.21,0:04:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit... That again? \NI wish he'd get his act together already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.49,0:04:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Think the concert's gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.58,0:04:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows she's just playing with him, \Nand he's still falling for it. What an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.91,0:04:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you stormed out like that... \NAre you gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.60,0:04:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine. I'll practice twice as hard \Nto make up for skipping out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? You're such a hard worker, Yuichi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.68,0:04:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So, where do you want to go today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.31,0:04:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Anywhere Kumiko-san takes me is fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.40,0:04:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.86,0:04:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my! What was that? \NYou sound like somebody's dad. {lit: that was like oyaji would behave}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.27,0:05:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your family's bathroom is seriously huge. \NIt feels amazing. {kei chi = kei family}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we're a big family. But it's all guys, \Nso the place always smells like sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.65,0:05:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Still, your brothers are pretty handsome. \NAnd your little brother's cute too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.81,0:05:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you're not serious, are you? \NThey're just big lumps with empty heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.22,0:05:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a mystery how a gorgeous girl like me \Nended up being born into this family.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.03,0:05:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, sure. My childhood friend, blessed with four huge older brothers,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,is truly a beauty unlike any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.05,0:05:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And on top of that, you've graciously allowed me to use this enormous bath. I'm forever grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.90,0:05:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.92,0:05:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Saori,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.96,0:05:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,how are things going with Yuichi-kun? {that worried you before}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.03,0:06:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with that sudden question?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.59,0:06:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you've got that "please listen to my problems" look on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.31,0:06:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.78,0:06:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.78,0:06:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Kei!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that reminds me. \NA package came for you while you were out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.21,0:06:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.95,0:06:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't! It could be a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.14,0:06:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.73,0:06:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's it from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see... The writing's \Nall smudged. I can't read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.54,0:06:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.72,0:06:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.11,0:06:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But who would send me something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.96,0:06:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares? It's probably a Christmas present from someone secretly in love with you, Saori!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.89,0:06:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't there a message card \Nor something inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.86,0:06:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.85,0:07:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strange. \NThen who on earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.56,0:07:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Yuichi-kun, I heard you're in a band.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.20,0:07:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.44,0:07:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.18,0:07:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What about singing? \NYou're the lead vocalist too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.43,0:07:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, I don't really sing. \NI'm the guitarist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.64,0:07:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then who does the singing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.86,0:07:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... I do a little too, \Nbut we've got another lead vocalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.93,0:07:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A cute girl named Saori, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.61,0:07:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.47,0:07:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... So is she your girlfriend, Yuichi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.60,0:07:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.03,0:07:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But you do have a girlfriend, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.95,0:07:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.51,0:07:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.51,0:07:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, quit teasing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.88,0:07:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When's your next concert?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.12,0:08:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to see your band sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.19,0:08:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? We're playing at a New Year's live show.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.11,0:08:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been making some \Nreally good progress with practice lately...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.06,0:08:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.06,0:08:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean... it'd make me really happy if you all came.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.21,0:08:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, excuse me. I just remembered \NI've got something to do. I'll head out first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.11,0:09:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.06,0:09:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? Oh yeah... It's Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.34,0:09:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're only realizing that now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.22,0:09:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking I ought to get something \Nfor our band's precious vocalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.34,0:09:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to force yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.74,0:09:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not forcing myself... \NWhat would you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.74,0:09:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then anything's fine, as long as it's something you want to give me, Yuichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.24,0:09:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.51,0:09:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuichi!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.80,0:09:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it really is him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.94,0:09:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No... It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.66,0:09:55.04,Thought,,0,0,0,,Did he finally notice me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.18,0:10:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it looking, Kenta?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.22,0:10:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Isao-kun \Nkeeping everyone together today,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.98,0:10:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone managed \Nto get through their own parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.43,0:10:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've still got a long way to go. \NWe need a lot more practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.93,0:10:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Let's take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.82,0:10:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yuichi, there's something \NI wanted to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.33,0:10:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.93,0:10:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Can it wait until next time?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.96,0:10:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.76,0:10:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Isao-chan, Kenta, sorry. \NI've got plans today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.50,0:10:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuichi, is it that woman again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.75,0:10:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll clean everything up myself next time, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.80,0:10:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So just let it slide today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.14,0:10:57.30,Thought,,0,0,0,,It can't be Yuichi. \NThere's no way he'd be that kind of guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.30,0:10:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.61,0:11:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuichi, can't you tell \Nthat woman's just playing with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.89,0:11:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever she does isn't any of my business,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.69,0:11:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but I hate seeing you trail \Nafter her like some puppy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.54,0:11:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have any pride? \NYou're the leader of this band.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.16,0:11:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.25,0:11:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't run away! Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.87,0:11:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you keep selling yourself so cheap?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.92,0:11:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't practice every single day just because the concert's coming up, did we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.93,0:11:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It was because we all decided \Nwe wanted to move one step forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.48,0:11:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.26,0:11:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,all you ever do is chase after skirts!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.36,0:11:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What have I been working so hard for\Nsinging your lousy songs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.06,0:11:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.72,0:11:44.77,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Saori!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.11,0:11:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.19,0:11:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.88,0:11:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. I know you needed to speak out. {??? dunno what he means, prolly that she needed to vent}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.27,0:11:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.27,0:11:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't said it, somebody else would've. Right, Kenta?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.39,0:12:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true. Though I would've said it a bit more calmly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.87,0:12:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.54,0:12:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.93,0:12:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.87,0:12:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Still... I can't believe I said all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.13,0:12:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All right then, it's tea time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.11,0:12:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.43,0:12:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Kenta, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.88,0:12:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My amp's been acting up a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.45,0:12:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You two go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.85,0:12:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Saori... Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.36,0:12:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.70,0:12:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you were yelling one minute \Nand crying the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.14,0:12:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you worried about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.64,0:12:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Saori... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.44,0:12:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.79,0:12:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.73,0:12:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean... If a guy like me's good enough, \Nyou can talk to me about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.72,0:12:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really sweet, Isao-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.10,0:13:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.76,0:13:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.69,0:13:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Saori. It's almost Christmas, and here I am \Nmaking you hang out with a guy like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you have plans \Nwith someone else or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.24,0:13:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.98,0:13:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Bet you've got people asking you out left and right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.78,0:13:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And then some mystery guy \Neven sends you a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.41,0:13:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.83,0:13:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If it were me, I wouldn't leave \Na great girl like you alone, Saori.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.67,0:13:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. So it was from Isao-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.84,0:13:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.86,0:13:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.47,0:13:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.77,0:13:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.60,0:13:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it was you. \NAnd that makes me so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.65,0:13:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... Hey, let me treat \Nyou to dinner today as thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.03,0:13:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but "thanks" for {\i1}what{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.83,0:13:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.57,0:14:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.47,0:14:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But... Hey, wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.68,0:14:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm treating, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.29,0:14:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.35,0:14:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So? It was delicious, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.58,0:14:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, thanks for the meal. \NI've never had real fried rice like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.20,0:14:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I think I drank a little too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.30,0:14:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because you were chugging the wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.80,0:14:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It would've been a waste not to. \NYou already ordered it, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.64,0:14:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.64,0:14:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll drive you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.64,0:14:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll be fine. \NYou don't have to go that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.32,0:14:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.65,0:14:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Is that so? But adults don't say silly things like that. {?? idk like waht}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.70,0:14:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So I guess you really are still a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.76,0:15:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.02,0:15:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, definitely a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.70,0:15:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.18,0:15:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing major...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.92,0:15:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The present was from Isao-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.17,0:15:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.02,0:15:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.67,0:15:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with that reaction?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.60,0:15:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I was sure it was from Yuichi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.16,0:15:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.03,0:15:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought it was Yuichi-kun too, \Ndidn't you, Saori?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.50,0:15:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Bull's-eye, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.02,0:15:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.28,0:16:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That idiot...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't try to hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why Yuichi-kun never notices you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... maybe he's just trying to be considerate. \NHe is the band leader, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.53,0:16:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever! I don't care about that pickup artist \Nwho's always chasing college girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:16:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.59,0:17:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.23,0:17:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.94,0:17:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry, but I cannot pick up right now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.69,0:17:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please leave your name, phone number, \Nand a message after the tone.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.59,0:17:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumiko... who the hell is Yuichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.38,0:17:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.63,0:17:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb. That's the name of the guy \Nyou were calling out all evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.10,0:17:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.10,0:17:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I did. It happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.95,0:18:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time I'm in bed with another guy, \NI'll call out your name instead, Kazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.19,0:18:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuichi's a nice name, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.82,0:18:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.41,0:18:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, it's Yuichi. Thanks for today. \NPlease invite me again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.57,0:18:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumiko-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.90,0:18:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So, where shall we go today?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.11,0:18:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... today I've got...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.33,0:18:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Christmas Eve. You've got time \Nto spend a little while with me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.38,0:19:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumiko-san, I really can't today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.75,0:19:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.01,0:19:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that idiot... \NIs he seriously not coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.39,0:19:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already after five. \NMaybe we should call it a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.56,0:19:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Kenta, I'm sorry, \Nbut can we wait a little longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.28,0:19:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He can be irresponsible,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.44,0:19:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's never skipped practice before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.69,0:19:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So just a little longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.40,0:19:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.37,0:19:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Why'd you freeze up? {???}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.63,0:19:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Your band?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.17,0:19:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.61,0:19:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's okay \Nto take a break once in a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.05,0:19:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, Yuichi-kun, you can \Nmake up for it with hard work, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.59,0:19:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I... don't take life all that seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.37,0:20:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But the band's the real deal! {I'm serious about the band}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.53,0:20:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't have a band with just one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.64,0:20:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the only reason \Nyou've been feeling down, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.85,0:20:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We came pretty close at the summer show. {meaning they took 2nd or 3rd place}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.76,0:20:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to blow it this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.86,0:20:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but please \Ndon't ask me out anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.99,0:20:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, just listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.86,0:20:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen. If you're with me, \Nyou can have just about anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.73,0:20:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Clothes, good food...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.15,0:20:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Even my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.52,0:20:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to walk away \Nwithout even taking a taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.55,0:20:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is Saori-chan really that important to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.16,0:20:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally realized which one matters most!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.34,0:20:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. Go play house with Saori-chan \Nto your heart's content. {lit: make-believe romance/play pretend at love}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.85,0:20:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.98,0:20:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.20,0:20:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm... gonna go look around for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.76,0:20:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll go too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.70,0:21:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess we're done for today, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.48,0:21:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Saori, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.93,0:21:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.51,0:21:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Saori! Oh, for crying out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.10,0:21:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.89,0:21:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea what time it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.06,0:21:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.15,0:21:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.31,0:21:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Went out to look for you, Yuichi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.03,0:21:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,When?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.03,0:21:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,About fifteen minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.48,0:21:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I've gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.88,0:21:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuichi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.62,0:21:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you even really serious about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.05,0:21:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, we won't be able \Nto practice tomorrow either!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.04,0:21:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'll definitely be there \Nfrom tomorrow on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.13,0:21:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Saori, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.56,0:22:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I have to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.27,0:22:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're in love with Yuichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.44,0:22:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.83,0:22:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.09,0:22:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.23,0:22:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.79,0:22:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I never wanted to make things harder for you. \NSo if you don't feel the same, just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.31,0:22:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.18,0:22:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.85,0:22:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,seeing the cheerful you slowly become more and more miserable every day...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.41,0:22:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,and not being able to do anything about it... \Nit was driving me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.23,0:22:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Isao-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.26,0:23:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,These are my true feelings for you, Saori. \NThis isn't pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.31,0:23:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about you, Saori. \NIf there's anything I can do for you, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.62,0:24:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Saori, let's go get something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.61,0:24:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Everywhere's probably packed since it's Christmas Eve, but I know a place. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.90,0:24:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.12,0:24:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.95,0:24:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.29,0:24:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... I can't do much, \Nbut is there anything you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.64,0:24:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.13,0:24:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.26,0:24:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,for a Christmas present.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.55,0:24:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.74,0:24:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably too late for that, {I'm sorry to be asking that so late}\Nbut I'll do whatever I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.14,0:24:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I couldn't... {/n-no wau}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.68,0:24:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.19,0:25:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Saori?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.74,0:25:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.97,0:25:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.38,0:25:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.05,0:25:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Saori?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.22,0:25:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm probably the only idiot out there \Nwho'd still chase after Yuichi. {probably means "won't give up on you"}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.60,0:25:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But weren't you with Isao-chan...?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.10,0:25:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I get it. Go. Go find Yuichi.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.15,0:25:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.83,0:25:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If that's what'll make Saori happy, \NI'll be a good sport about it. {lit: it's not my time to act/turn to appear - meaning he won't get between them two}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.36,0:25:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.82,0:25:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, who else is going to sing \NYuichi's lousy songs?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.67,0:25:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably only Saori.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.47,0:25:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What about that college girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.01,0:25:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,She dumped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.09,0:25:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.83,0:26:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I finally realized something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.92,0:26:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Saori's the only one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.67,0:26:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How many girls have you fooled with that line?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.29,0:26:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm always the one who gets fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.16,0:26:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never deceived anyone, not even once.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.31,0:26:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that supposed to be a pickup line?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.78,0:26:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not "supposed to be." I mean it! {lit: it's not intended, it's real}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.92,0:26:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How many girls have you said that to?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.94,0:26:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the first, Saori.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.53,0:26:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.88,0:26:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Teddy Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.38,0:26:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.41,0:26:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.02,0:26:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like everything finally worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.60,0:26:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid me... I actually \Ngot my hopes up for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.71,0:26:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that lucky Yuichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.64,0:26:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better make this work.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.24,0:26:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.40,0:27:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A white Christmas, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.62,0:27:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about romantic! Damn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.51,0:27:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All right... let's show 'em how it's done! {??? lit: let's go shall we}
Dialogue: 10,0:27:34.88,0:27:43.40,Song,,0,0,0,,A gentle breeze slips in through the window, {copied from episode 2}
Dialogue: 10,0:27:43.40,0:27:52.18,Song,,0,0,0,,summer's gaze falling softly \Nacross my shoulders
Dialogue: 10,0:27:52.18,0:27:59.19,Song,,0,0,0,,You appeared like tangled rays of light
Dialogue: 10,0:28:00.83,0:28:11.27,Song,,0,0,0,,A chance meeting I couldn't escape,\Nleaving me speechless
Dialogue: 10,0:28:11.71,0:28:15.10,Song,,0,0,0,,Just such hidden eyes...
Dialogue: 10,0:28:15.10,0:28:19.90,Song,,0,0,0,,somebody tell me
Dialogue: 10,0:28:20.84,0:28:28.43,Song,,0,0,0,,these trembling heartbeats \Nare beyond counting
Dialogue: 10,0:28:28.87,0:28:32.16,Song,,0,0,0,,Just a little bit of love {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:28:32.16,0:28:45.75,Song,,0,0,0,,Even if this love disappears in ten seconds,\NI still want you to hold me
Dialogue: 10,0:28:47.74,0:29:05.11,Song,,0,0,0,,An ordinary emergency exit on a city building, its rusty door always kept shut
Dialogue: 10,0:29:05.11,0:29:12.52,Song,,0,0,0,,As the season begins to fade away, \NI run up and look at the moon
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.74,0:29:24.60,Song,,0,0,0,,Stretching before me above the city skyline, the scent of moonlit wind... {a bit more can be heard than in ep2}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.60,0:29:27.17,Song,,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,2544)}Just such hidden eyes...
Comment: 0,0:29:27.17,0:29:30.17,Song,,0,0,0,,
